==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
This stage is pretty easy like the previous one, so you can use basically any strategy you want. As long as you have most [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]], you be able to breeze through it.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
The Star Pengs may pose a bit of a problem, but a few [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]] (or almost any [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Anti-Alien]] unit, for that matter) can keep them at bay. The rest of the enemies are nothing your other cats can't deal with.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Still similar to Chapters 1 and 2 despite the strength magnifications being much higher. The Star Pengs, being the main threat, can still easily be dealt with using [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]] or [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]].

